Id: cont012w
Severity: WARN
Category: containers
Check: check_containers
References: https://docs.docker.com/engine/security/#docker-daemon-attack-surface
Controls: CIS 4.1, 5.4; NIST AC-6, CM-7; ISO 8.2, 8.9; CE Secure configuration, User access control

Daemon configuration (/etc/docker, daemon.json) is owned by someone
other than root: whoever they are controls what the daemon reads at
startup, and so the daemon, which runs as root. Ownership of the
daemon's configuration is root's to hold.
